{ type: upgrade
  maximum_version: "1.2.0"
  message: <<EOM
Stalwart 1.2.0 adds new permissions that default roles created by an
earlier version do not include:

  - user, group and administrator roles: sysMailRule*, sysBlockedSender*,
    sysSafeSender* and sysCalendarSettings*
  - administrator role: sysExchangeGet and sysExchangeUpdate

Add them with the recovery administrator, or start the server once with
STALWART_UPDATE_ROLE_PERMISSIONS=true, e.g.:

  # sysrc stalwart_env="STALWART_UPDATE_ROLE_PERMISSIONS=true"
  # service stalwart restart
  # sysrc -x stalwart_env

The WebUI should also be upgraded to version 2.1.1.
See https://stalw.art/docs/auth/authorization/permissions
EOM
}
